Step-by-Step Guide

1️⃣  Click "Browse" → Select your Excel file (.xlsx or .xlsm)

2️⃣  Choose which Sheet to process (or leave as "ALL")

3️⃣  Select the Column that contains the values you want to split by
     Example: Column E has manager names

4️⃣  Click "Load Data" → Tool scans and shows all unique values

5️⃣  Select the values you want (or click "Select All")

6️⃣  Choose your output folder

7️⃣  Click "PROCESS FILES" → Done! 🎉
